&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;We thank the Polk County District Attorney&rsquo;s Office for their thorough prosecution and the Marion County Sheriff&rsquo;s Office for their assistance during the call. This case is a strong example of teamwork &mdash; from alarm to arrest to sentencing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova,arial nova_embeddedfont,arial nova_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
