&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;Deputies and other area law enforcement agencies looked for Vancil&rsquo;s vehicle throughout the morning and day. They were unable to locate it and did not know where he may have gone. That evening, Vancil arrived at the Lane County Parole &amp;amp; Probation Office in Eugene in his vehicle. He was detained and deputies responded to contact Vancil. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
