&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;The driver instead continued speeding until he crashed into the ditch, just before entering Lowell where other vehicles were on the road. The deputy arrested Gaffney without further incident. During the arrest, a two loaded firearms were found concealed in the vehicle. After additional investigation, Gaffney was arrested and lodged at the Lane County Jail for: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
